{"time": 1762784196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "773120508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "缪尔赛斯看了一眼克里斯滕，总辖稍微停了一下，随后起身离开，这件事她只需要做一个首肯即可。随着她离开，白发的龙人也跟着离场，现场的氛围一瞬轻松了许多。“好啦，菲拉，或者斯薇塔，你们跟这三位说一说任务内容吧？”"}
{"time": 1762784196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "145972929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我只有源石技艺方面的理论比较扎实，我也能去吗？”"}
{"time": 1762784208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "937890448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=145972929]问我的主任。"}
{"time": 1762784255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1357470183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "”这次的行动是要去极北冰原“"}
{"time": 1762784285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1215786937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "激动的点点头，已经摩拳擦掌迫不及待了"}
{"time": 1762784291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "587873700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=937890448]多萝西此时连瞌睡的点头都没有了，你只听见她轻微的呼吸声，居然坐着睡着了。"}
{"time": 1762784324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1790344545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "\"那边发现了一个城市遗迹\""}
{"time": 1762784376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "899466864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“芭芙娜，主攻是远距离打击支援”*向前半步，既然对方说明了任务我就说明自己的定位"}
{"time": 1762784428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2084993069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“对地点我没有好恶，但去那种地方有没有准备防寒装备？”"}
{"time": 1762784432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "973652986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "\"这个在极北遗迹是一个全新的发现，可能对我们公司极北科研考试有突破性的意义\""}
{"time": 1762784433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1647425682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“有先遣队去过了吗？获取到什么信息了吗？”"}
{"time": 1762784438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2110605627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉…”找个毯子给主任盖上。"}
{"time": 1762784472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "972659017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（会议室里哪来的摊子）"}
{"time": 1762784474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "896585486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "\"你们也看到了，克总也来亲自决定此事，\""}
{"time": 1762784475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "686482735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（毯子）"}
{"time": 1762784505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "8061175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（肯定有吧，主任不是第一次睡着了）"}
{"time": 1762784528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1668286882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "”先遣队在那边发现的城市遗迹，我们正式要过去支援她们“"}
{"time": 1762784588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "468686662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我看她也不是很感兴趣”*不着痕迹地看一眼出门的方向"}
{"time": 1762784595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "694936660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "”极北冰原除了冷，也有可能随时发生源石冰晶风暴“"}
{"time": 1762784598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1650373282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "默默的听着"}
{"time": 1762784629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1113941158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“有备好极地防寒服吗？”"}
{"time": 1762784637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1611301889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=145972929]”所以你的源石技艺理论知识可以完全排上用场“"}
{"time": 1762784638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1180617896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“过去的话有当地向导吗”"}
{"time": 1762784669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1502078022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "”多萝西主任看来培养起一位了不起的新人啊。“"}
{"time": 1762784763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1928887415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "”我刚才黄石火山公园考察回来，具体情况我也不太清楚，极北冰原那边也是刚刚恢复通信，具体情况不是很明朗。“"}
{"time": 1762784856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1477433639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "扭头看上老马”马主任，我们不是麦姐这种站立型黎波利，生态科有提供足够的设备工具和极地防寒服吧？“"}
{"time": 1762784865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1860447479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“地图也是必不可少的物品”"}
{"time": 1762784873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "421225830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“雪原上极其容易迷失方向”"}
{"time": 1762784892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042457774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“当然，此次由我司全权提供补给，另外...”绿头发尖耳朵的女士抬起手轻点，会议室的天花板开裂开来，一整排类似探照灯的仪器之下，一整个全息头像出现在你们面前的桌上。"}
{"time": 1762784952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1974821354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（麦哲伦在极北遗迹调查，生死不明，那就是死了）"}
