{"time": 1762949837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2019236659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "生态科的职员并没有过问除了菲拉之外的申请表"}
