{"time": 1763043335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1899353278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“肉食动物不太好吃，但是皮毛不错”"}
{"time": 1763043344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1735555545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“算额外收入了，五五分？”"}
