{"time": 1763043537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "897528656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "阿尔忒弥斯独自来到了酒吧，这里虽然装修奢华，但只有前台一个孤零零的机器人。"}
{"time": 1763043542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1654946315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=1370316409]"}
