{"time": 1763043585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1362452298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=897528656]（是不是叫闭嘴）"}
{"time": 1763043617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1031456359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"您好，我是这里的酒保机器人，闭嘴。\""}
{"time": 1763043643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "196770763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你可以看到墙上琳琅满目的酒类，几乎应有尽有，想来是因为麦哲伦平常也没有喝酒的习惯。"}
{"time": 1763043683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681434851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“会调酒吗？要一杯日出龙舌兰”"}
{"time": 1763043693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1295407491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我的冷笑话时间呢）"}
{"time": 1763043743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1900092644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（”如果你喝多了日出龙舌兰倒下了，就会变成中出龙舌兰“）"}
{"time": 1763043770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "287420817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没问题，闭嘴最擅长调酒。\"它调酒的速度奇快"}
{"time": 1763043841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1568885747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*炫"}
{"time": 1763043847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "517401943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“请品尝这道「日出龙舌兰」。它用料健康、分量刚好、味道清爽，正适合用来加餐。而且它的名字也颇具巧思——日出龙舌尖轻点兰香，哈哈，令人忍俊不禁。”说完它递给你一杯色泽清爽的特调酒。"}
{"time": 1763043880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1888745002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "(没活了)"}
{"time": 1763043925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "76535253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "想来只有酒和刀火不会背叛自己，而这里，不缺酒，也不缺手里的刀。"}
{"time": 1763043936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1456075741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*离开"}
{"time": 1763043952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1180169941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“有免费的酒喝也不算什么差事”"}
{"time": 1763044048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1707911388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "稍晚时候，外出的二人拎着打猎得胜的三匹狼回到了基地，从训练室出来的菲拉刻晴，品了一下午闭嘴笑话的鸡尾酒的阿尔忒弥斯"}
{"time": 1763044056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "807386748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "再度在生活区前汇合"}
{"time": 1763044078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "337938016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "当然，外出的二人身上都带着一看就是咬伤的痕迹"}
{"time": 1763044101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2116965373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“？你们不会被猎物打了吧”"}
{"time": 1763044112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1378286215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "”哇哇哇，你们被狗啃了?“"}
{"time": 1763044276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "889550397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是狼。真可惜你们不在场”"}
