{"time": 1763045435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418353327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（这个算不算）"}
{"time": 1763045442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438925224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你们身上的伤很快被包扎好，但还是接到了不要大幅运动的医嘱。"}
{"time": 1763045448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "595931001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=459BF71FFEEFCEFA99D16D46FC2073AB.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQ59yNKGZhy4G9eNmkOMmQmNT4jUxjD2gEg_wooiM-NhLDvkAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQZkVrxlqyVfa-eD5KctlRxnoC2FqCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMEy6RufvLPAyVsUo87rySqvbHeyKK0Go4-bFTrf_cQ-LzBXp7EWekNiEXwyTk7aKAg,file_size=27971]"}
{"time": 1763045482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2136173978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“没事，就这点伤口第二天就好了，瓦伊凡部族都是这么过来的。”"}
{"time": 1763045487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757161416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(算吧)"}
{"time": 1763045502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1407129696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "机器人没再说什么。"}
{"time": 1763045528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1941972182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(唉，我的三个pl都消失了)"}
{"time": 1763045655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "439940215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*去找麦哲伦问问护甲的事"}
{"time": 1763045658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "622848015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有点不知道接下来该做什么"}
{"time": 1763045662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1934954949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去吃晚饭吧"}
{"time": 1763045678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1756622020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "斯薇塔和刻晴找到麦哲伦时，她正在餐桌前和菲拉说话，\"菲拉要的甜可可，真是的...明明也没多久没见，怎么就缠着我要手调。\""}
{"time": 1763045709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1973632377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "”是糖可可，我不是说了你很像东国的那个小偶像嘛“"}
{"time": 1763045717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1846624355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“麦哲伦前辈，请问你最近有在周围看到过狼群吗？”"}
{"time": 1763045814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1703773389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=438925224]*不知道说什么好，总之回去休息了"}
{"time": 1763045837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2024679410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不吃饭?)"}
{"time": 1763045848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1230915386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这么快吗）"}
{"time": 1763045855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452994331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*那就去餐厅"}
{"time": 1763045857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1634660114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "”对了，麦姐，那个多萝西主任给的无人机好不好用，我还留了一个，能不能帮我把这个低能量法术打击模组安装上去，你在放一个摄像头，这样可以看着我们。“"}
{"time": 1763045871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "916701226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "黎博利进门的时候正听见菲林这段话"}
{"time": 1763045974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1827994474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"别急别急...\""}
{"time": 1763046010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "101302088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“周围的齿兽比我在老家见过的最强的猎物都要强，如果营地有多余的护甲装备，可以先暂时借用一下吗？”"}
{"time": 1763046069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2051646035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她放下手里的杯子，\"首先东国的小偶像，我没有听说过。\"她打了个哈欠，\"基底附近一直有一些齿兽徘徊，不过也袭击不了我们的基地，所以就没去管它们。\""}
{"time": 1763046115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1782684604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...看你们的样子，刚刚狩猎回来?\"她仔细看了看斯薇塔和芭芙娜，\"受伤的话记得好好处理。\""}
{"time": 1763046167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438228673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那群野兽居然能伤到斯维塔和巴芙娜前辈。。。一定很厉害”"}
{"time": 1763046171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1979693947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=101302088]\"唔...主任没有给你们装备吗？\""}
{"time": 1763046206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "671194441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=916701226]（哪段）"}
{"time": 1763046223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "224857108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1634660114]\"我都说了，我这边接不到信号吧...\"她有些宠溺地摸了摸你的脑袋，\"不过改装的事交给我就行，待会我去工作台给你看看。\""}
{"time": 1763046227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "297170127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是，哪有菲林）"}
{"time": 1763046243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1247030824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1782684604](就这里吧)"}
{"time": 1763046245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "999355023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（菲拉）"}
{"time": 1763046248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "975378150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
{"time": 1763046304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1285615738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“主任仅仅只是发了预防高浓度源石环境的科考服，并没有发战斗用的护甲。”"}
{"time": 1763046312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2091674280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“处理过了，和人做的一样好”*坐在桌边“这边吃饭怎么弄？”"}
{"time": 1763046347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1722388343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“但是感觉这次考察应该会遇到了不得的强敌啊，我和芭芙娜前辈都成这样了。”"}
{"time": 1763046409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122593716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"和那边的机器管家说一声，它会做给我们。\"那个机器管家浑身穿着针织衫，袖口绣着可爱的企鹅标签，想来只有这里是麦哲伦的常驻地之一，她对你点点头。"}
{"time": 1763046471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "437196350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1722388343]\"毕竟是有凶性的雪狼。\"她思考了一下，\"基地里平常也不做战斗准备，唔...稍晚的时候你可以去仓库里看看。\""}
{"time": 1763046522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "176029287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那好，现在还是先吃饭吧，刚才战斗完我肚子都饿瘪了。”"}
{"time": 1763046577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "700187579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*找机器管家要点红菜汤、驮兽肉和土豆泥，开饭。"}
{"time": 1763046612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783766343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "”如果遇到猛兽应该第一时间逃跑，我们这次也是科研目的的探索，不是非要打什么猎物回来“"}
{"time": 1763046622, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649231611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "”我们这一路应该不会有什么危险的“"}
{"time": 1763046657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651746472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"小菲拉说的是呢。\"麦哲伦点点头，\"以探索为目标吧，遇到事不要硬上。\""}
{"time": 1763046657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "453877650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“但是我在老家遇到过的猎物都没有今天遇到的这么强。”"}
{"time": 1763046673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "222033430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“以往三只齿兽我一个人都能无伤应对。”"}
{"time": 1763046725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "395449516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“绝对是这里有什么不对劲的地方，可能是源石风暴的影响。”"}
{"time": 1763046842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "72780337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "”总之，下次不可以这样了，如果你受伤了，那我们生态调查科就不收你了知道吗？“"}
{"time": 1763046849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1552477731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*点一份哥伦比亚鹰嘴豆炖菜，坐着慢慢吃了"}
{"time": 1763046951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "769708265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=72780337]“我还是觉得多萝西主任对我挺好的…”"}
{"time": 1763046964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1657422707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "*点了一大份莱塔尼亚烤猪蹄和塔拉咖啡"}
{"time": 1763046979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "937158841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（泰拉好像没有猪这个东西）"}
{"time": 1763047024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "451742531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（澄闪说是）"}
{"time": 1763047046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1625598662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=72780337] ”总之，下次不可以这样了，如果你受伤了，那我们科学考察科就不收你了知道吗？“"}
{"time": 1763047101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1734786953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "*机器管家好像没有相应，重新再点了一份莱塔利亚香肠拼盘和塔拉咖啡"}
