{"time": 1763736577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1784745442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "紧密的仪器摆放地整整齐齐，上面大多带有罗德岛的logo，很多都实现了无人操纵，你们只需要按照舰内ai的指示去往相应的地方检查"}
{"time": 1763736601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1639664420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=32914613]（so？）"}
{"time": 1763736649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1740328000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不用，不过有别的问题”看大部分人都去医疗部了，这才开口"}
{"time": 1763736664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1108450470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“科长研究过附近的动物吗？”"}
{"time": 1763736667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1245211110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "*正在哼着歌准备着咖啡和牛奶，显然昨天无事发生的🐏不觉得自己是被召唤的那个"}
{"time": 1763736683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1279273023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我先来吧”"}
{"time": 1763736695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "383516752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“有过一些研究，应该没什么特别的。”"}
{"time": 1763736743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "44134259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1279273023]当然是常规的体检过程，抽血，胸透等等，流程很快，几分钟就弄完了整套流程。"}
{"time": 1763736765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "257935764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“大概多久可以出结果呢...”"}
{"time": 1763736782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337137292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*紧随其后做检查"}
{"time": 1763736861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1284450671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=383516752]“这样。我昨天处理皮毛的时候，余光好像扫到一眼皮肉之间有些白色的晶体”*下意识瞥了一眼自己的伤口“而且费劲，别的动物身上有过类似的情况吗？”"}
{"time": 1763736906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "193031224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=257935764]当然不用太久，很快一张表出现在你的手中，各项指标都显示正常"}
{"time": 1763736914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "319307055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1337137292]你也是，正常"}
{"time": 1763736941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236523779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“咦？是心理作用吧”捂着自己的小肚子，还是感觉热热的"}
{"time": 1763736949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "234682769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“可能要筛查一下附近的精神干扰源，巧合这个时候出现，绝非是偶然”"}
