{"time": 1763737049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "736913400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1284450671]“白色的晶体？”她也跟着盯着你的伤口，“什么样子的？”"}
{"time": 1763737057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1796076304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“报告出来了，看上去没什么问题，你们在研究什么？”"}
{"time": 1763737103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1761252772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有点像盐……或者碎冰？”*回忆一下“总之，不像会出现在皮下的东西。专门去看的时候又看不见了”"}
{"time": 1763737149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1075037249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "至少从纸面的结果上，你们的身体各项机能都没有出问题，现阶段只能认为是心理作用吧？至于精神干扰，ai表示只能作为可能的心理原因，待考"}
{"time": 1763737180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "361508693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回去和众人汇合，感觉没有这么简单"}
