{"time": 1763737222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "376288888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "*顺手，洒上一些香料（肉桂粉），然后顺便拿了一包孜然放进口袋里"}
{"time": 1763737269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "435749289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“设备和中继装置有预备吗”"}
{"time": 1763737278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "109270794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“我们可以考虑出发的事情了”"}
{"time": 1763737392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "723618768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1761252772]“嚯...这还真是，我待会会去看一下你们昨天的猎物，放在哪？”"}
{"time": 1763737399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "91355497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*记录一下她们说的症状"}
{"time": 1763737456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1452126190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=109270794]她接过菲拉递过的摩卡，“嗯...好香，小菲拉没少泡嘛。”紧接着开口回答你，“当然，腾腾一早就放在了出口附近，各位可以随时出发，”"}
{"time": 1763737509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "453025824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=723618768]“肉在冷库，皮在仓库”*看起来一时半会也没下文“……那就之后再说吧”"}
{"time": 1763737542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2079136862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“当然，如果各位还有遇见类似的猎物，也可以把他们狩猎之后带回来。”她说着看了一眼菲拉，“别烧坏了。”"}
{"time": 1763737594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1472360793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“我原则上来说是素食主义者，不烤肉！”"}
