{"time": 1763737784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2072548697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "气温当然在零下，天空还盘悬着大雪，风力大概在四级，刮西南风，仪器如此显示"}
{"time": 1763737847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1495220647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“天气不太好，下雪了啊，昨天还没下雪呢。”"}
{"time": 1763737859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1883540429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（你什么时候知道昨天没下雪的）"}
