{"time": 1764593833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2022685213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "但是菲拉似乎在之前传回的典籍上，看见过一些有趣的内容。"}
