{"time": 1764593881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "494504776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "*但是还是把思绪落回到石头上面。"}
{"time": 1764593916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1819792652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（所以这石头是不是附魔了一个驱寒术，）"}
{"time": 1764593978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632727222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“你有看出什么不同之处吗”"}
{"time": 1764594019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2073037159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2022685213]之前的记录显示这种深藏于雪地深处的宝石，在某种意义上，起到了一种预兆的作用。"}
{"time": 1764594026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245479720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“这个石头好像在朋友家的藏书里面见过。”"}
{"time": 1764594111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "733022395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "常规而言，这种宝石会提供一个15尺内群体的驱寒术，当周围环境（包括气候、源石浓度、地质）出现剧烈变化时，宝石会散发出红色的脉冲波动，整体变为暗红色，热量也会更剧烈。对于本地人而言，这是一种判断灾变的手段。"}
{"time": 1764594128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "479664043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "(天灾信使)"}
