{"time": 1764594188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1902384701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（5）"}
{"time": 1764594304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "191719199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "其他人在冰冻大虫的尸体里翻翻捡捡，找到了一些可以称之为冷冻液的东西，似乎可以造成短时的温度骤降。"}
{"time": 1764594320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035797730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "(有几个)"}
{"time": 1764594341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1712709983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "如果收集的话，可以收集三到四瓶的样子。"}
{"time": 1764594404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "303530806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“书上说，北原有一种很神奇的宝石。这种宝石可以提高附近的温度，然后周围环境恶劣变化的时候，会发出长波。这个就是一个天然的天气瓶。在我们书里面好像把这个石头称作厉石·临。”"}
{"time": 1764594425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989722198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“我们好像摸到真货了。”"}
{"time": 1764594426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1951682833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“你们有随身携带一些试管之类的的东西吗”"}
{"time": 1764594431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1972326648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好厉害的石头”"}
{"time": 1764594434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "136998134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "但在雪原，这种材料用处并不大，但作为报酬结算的话，每一瓶都值两个源石锭"}
{"time": 1764594448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "519264213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“这些冷冻液好像蛮不错的”"}
{"time": 1764594456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "88948048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（所以能安装法杖上面吗？）"}
{"time": 1764594457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "220336610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不愧是菲拉酱，简直是持石专家”"}
{"time": 1764594491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2017722453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=88948048](可以，但是你得找人帮你装)"}
