{"time": 1764595222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "479477285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看上去就像是藏尸场一般，新的骨头压在老的骨头上，带血的冰碴之下，是冻日已久的冰冷白骨。"}
{"time": 1764595223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "670833477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“这是兽骨还是，别的什么库兰塔头骨？”"}
