{"time": 1764595798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1451117339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（哦，我一直在说话）"}
{"time": 1764595800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "144216926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“我们，还是不要在这里呆着吧。这里像是莱恩第二饭堂的剩菜桶。”"}
{"time": 1764595803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2031219287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么有人骨？这地方哪来的人？”"}
{"time": 1764595837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098523324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“这片大地总是会有很多神奇的东西。”"}
{"time": 1764595841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1858877935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我说话有声音吗、）"}
{"time": 1764595844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1643250626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“我们要小心了。”"}
{"time": 1764595887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1675281186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那些人骨深埋在最底下一层，就像是，基石一般?"}
{"time": 1764595910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "538783074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“最好还是找个地方先休息一下，大家都受伤了。”"}
