{"time": 1765888254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2070480810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "菲拉在附近设置好了中继器，不过在这种骸骨堆上，难道要设置短休的营地？"}
{"time": 1765888270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1354546462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“无人机能找到一片足够驻扎的区域吗”"}
{"time": 1765888284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2060195129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“这片地域看上去也不太安宁”"}
{"time": 1765888302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "661996680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（那之前往北飞的时候发现了啥）"}
{"time": 1765888414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1733909443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“要么退回刚刚的水池那里休整，或者再往东走一点。这片区域确实有点,,,不太卫生”"}
{"time": 1765888420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1008298303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(之前就飞到这了)"}
