{"time": 1765888509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1513368202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "再次放飞无人机，往东方向飞。"}
{"time": 1765888542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1217854743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“回到之前那个入口处，找个避风的地方搭个雪屋吧。”"}
{"time": 1765888572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "610215164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“在我老家有时候过夜狩猎，就会暂时这样休息一下。”"}
{"time": 1765888581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1616168070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“好，然后我们在北面的小山上面设置中继点。”"}
