{"time": 1765888637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2111650012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=9A1BFA2FA8607EFE4A89A2CC19F8F872.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTdNuJaPsPl2Ty_7xnYpqXWkSKSsBjstxkg_woooPbQ5o_CkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQWuCYGTzDWl8SQ0JKFfFXYHoC4R-CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMPz5KIMIatXrv9DXa9nd_Nv9DXfALwVeKlr2fVP7H_yZbQfLAZLhluSYYqWvluKfoQ,file_size=416748]（这里）"}
