{"time": 1765889969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419845393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(新三台词有点多了)"}
{"time": 1765890002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1535370425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这种地方，没什么条件，凑合凑合就行了”拿出干粮"}
{"time": 1765890015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1329872978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=582370927]附近的雪在火下消融掉了，但也浸透了半截木柴，大概火持续不了太久。"}
{"time": 1765890033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864339827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "放进锅里随意煮煮，软到能下咽就行"}
{"time": 1765890055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1011903058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“我昨天看到你们打猎以为能吃上肉了，结果还是要啃干粮啊。”拿出干粮"}
{"time": 1765890059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1614221350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=117154409]比起干粮，你曾喝过的胡萝卜汤让你感到鲜美无比。"}
{"time": 1765890124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1280378398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，可惜没有酸汤喝...”"}
{"time": 1765890136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253344652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“昨天打猎到的是齿兽，肉不会很好吃的。”"}
{"time": 1765890137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1650984654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（咱家不怕酸！）"}
{"time": 1765890148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1010631378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“肉在站里。今天倒是也杀了些本地动物吧，不过看着就不太能吃”"}
{"time": 1765890148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1920900017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“而且那群齿兽的肉有一点问题。”"}
{"time": 1765890219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "235663523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“问题？是在站里那个情况吗”"}
{"time": 1765890276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1950954325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你是指什么情况？”"}
{"time": 1765890329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1588878483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "(不是那个白色那个？)"}
{"time": 1765890354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1247463740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是啊）"}
{"time": 1765890381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "246621013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“提醒我了，我们是不是忘记检查今天干掉的敌人了？”"}
{"time": 1765890390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1177513621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "*掏出今天那个宝珠”你们有谁会武器改装吗？“"}
{"time": 1765890396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "667851401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“现在来看也来得及”"}
{"time": 1765890406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "771132722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "摇摇头"}
{"time": 1765890414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1764873937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*查看一下"}
