{"time": 1765890555, "type": "recv", "message_id": "559359289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“要是热量够高其实会引来野兽”"}
{"time": 1765890559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "374352923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“在这种雪原里”"}
{"time": 1765890575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "952559352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还有这种事吗”有些好奇"}
{"time": 1765890693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "645675759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "宝珠还在持续散发着热量，至少你们周围的温度并没有即将入夜的冰冷。"}
{"time": 1765890855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "848144008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "”那这东西毕竟是刻晴你打捞上来的，这里的火也烧不了多少时间，还是暂时由你保管吧，至少可以驱寒。“"}
{"time": 1765890891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1936705803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还是菲拉拿着吧，我又不会用”"}
{"time": 1765890951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1147460620", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“别谦让了，先把食物准备一下”"}
{"time": 1765890977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1868731259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "*尝试和麦哲伦联系"}
{"time": 1765890981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "206004777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我觉得这东西应该不只是能取暖这么简单”摇摇头“不过确实该准备食物。我今天没怎么受伤，可以出去看看”"}
{"time": 1765891038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1553524867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "”那我陪你一起去吧，趁天还没黑。“"}
{"time": 1765891042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "965785085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“一个人吗？”"}
{"time": 1765891060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "760672498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“现在要天黑了，你一个人出来恐怕不太妥当吧”"}
{"time": 1765891106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2093038761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "坐在火堆旁休息"}
{"time": 1765891114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "71108683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“又不走远，碰碰运气而已。如果这点距离也能碰上难缠的家伙，我建议我们还是换个地方扎营”简单喝两口热水暖暖身子，就站起来"}
